	)
	(text "On input, 10uF + 220nF and output 4x22uF were selected \nas per Design Requirements section in LMR33630 datasheet. \n\nTarget switching frequency is 400kHz, Vout is 5V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 85.598 149.098 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "a08f7885-e776-4e75-8894-dceae2a12a64")
	)
	(text "Chosen based on the inductance and saturation current.\n\nInductance is based on the pk-pk ripple current, \nand chosen to be in the range of 30% of the max load current\nL = (Vin-Vout) / (fsw * 0.3 * Iout) * (Vout/Vin)\n\nIout =~ 1.5 A (1.25A firing circuit, ~150mA logic)\n\nL = (8.4-5) / (400k * 0.3 * 1.5) * (5/8.4)\nL =~ 11.2 uH\n\nSelect L = 10uH ; in between TI's reccomended 8uH and theoretical 11.2"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 84.836 171.958 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "d09444f8-95e6-40aa-9588-09ebde38166a")
	)
	(text "pad in case we ever want to jump EN over \neasily to VIN and enforce constant operation"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 90.678 93.726 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.889 0.889)
				(thickness 0.1588)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "d1d23e03-5bc8-40ca-9e4b-cfb3083c1968")
	)
	(text "Input & Output Capacitors\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 98.298 143.256 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "dc82db95-37fc-4ba3-9892-d156fe6731c7")
	)
	(text "The 3.3V backplane is inverted with an NMOS \nto pull the enable pin LOW and turn it OFF\nwhen the board is in the stack. A pull-up resistor\nestablishes a default ON state. "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 33.02 150.114 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e2aed5bb-b693-449a-8801-5e25cbf5b046")
	)
	(text "Vs 	= 3.3 V\nVf 	= 2.0 V\nI  	= 10 mA = 0.01 A\nR  	= 1.3 / 0.01 = 130 R (~150 R)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 323.596 233.934 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e38b094f-3810-42e0-b1d4-b52a07f0fd2c")
	)
	(text "Backplane Presence-Based Enable\n\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 49.784 144.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "ea705655-3308-4169-b320-b02fdce24141")
	)
	(text "A feed-forward capacitor is used to improve load transient response, forming a high-pass filter\\\n\nCff < (Vout * Cout) / 120 * R32 * sqrt(Vref/Vout)\nC15 < (5 * 88u) / 120 * 100k * 0.4472 <~ 81.99 pF \n\nAccounting for capacitor derating and looking at standard E12 values:\nCff = 56pF (well below upper limit)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 150.368 167.894 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ec692494-9822-44c9-87b9-c45b083679c9")
	)
